Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-4 V4, boxed "Touch". 2026-09-29.
Flashed Waveshare's own factory image ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-4-V4.0-FactoryOnly-251122.bin
(sha256 5db7ee79f1063465d8114cea3a4675c8c87bdf303c2a3edaf6a55414c8634706, from
github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-4/firmware) at 0x0. Boot log over USB serial:

