expression: bsp_touch_new(((void *)0), &tp)

The factory firmware aborts on the missing touch controller and reboots in a loop (the buzzer
sounds on each boot). Display, backlight, BLE and the CH32 expander work under ECHO_MiniDaemon;
an I2C scan there shows only 0x24 (CH32) and 0x51 (RTC), never the GT911 at 0x5D or 0x14.
